SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK B1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T01. "검색조건
  PARAMETERS: P_WERKS LIKE ZGTPPT1090-WERKS MEMORY ID WRK,  "플랜트
              P_SPGCD LIKE ZGTPPT1090-SPGCD.                "SPG코드
  SELECT-OPTIONS: S_BBID FOR ZGTPPT1090-BOBINID,            "보빈ID
                  S_PI   FOR ZGTPPT1090-PI,                 "보빈규격(파이)
                  S_DRNO FOR ZGTPPT1090-ZGTDRNO,            "보빈드럼No.
                  S_CRDAT FOR ZGTPPT1090-CRDAT MODIF ID S1, "생성/변경일
                  S_IFDAT FOR ZGTPPT1100-IFDAT MODIF ID S2. "전송일
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK B1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK B2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T02. "인터페이스 전송
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 1(20) TEXT-001. "처리모드선택
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 25.
    PARAMETERS P_SEND RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1 USER-COMMAND U1 DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 27(10) TEXT-002 FOR FIELD P_SEND. "전송
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 40.
    PARAMETERS P_DISP RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 44(10) TEXT-003 FOR FIELD P_DISP. "로그조회(재처리)
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.

  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 1(20) TEXT-004 MODIF ID S2. "조회모드선책
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 25.
    PARAMETERS P_ALL RADIOBUTTON GROUP R2 USER-COMMAND U2 DEFAULT 'X' MODIF ID S2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 27(10) TEXT-005 FOR FIELD P_ALL MODIF ID S2. "전체
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 40.
    PARAMETERS P_SUC RADIOBUTTON GROUP R2 MODIF ID S2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 44(10) TEXT-006 FOR FIELD P_SUC MODIF ID S2. "성공건만
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 57.
    PARAMETERS P_FAIL RADIOBUTTON GROUP R2 MODIF ID S2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 61(10) TEXT-007 FOR FIELD P_FAIL MODIF ID S2. "오류건만
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.

  PARAMETERS: P_TARGET LIKE ZGTPPT1100-ZSYSTEM_ID. "송신대상시스템
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK B2.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK B3 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T03. "처리옵션
  PARAMETERS P_BATCH AS CHECKBOX MODIF ID S1. "배치모드
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK B3.
